PROJECT LICENSE DECISION PENDING

This integration does not select or grant a new project-wide license on
behalf of the existing copyright holders. Repository access is not a claim
that all project material has an open-source redistribution license.

The repository owner and relevant contributors must approve a suitable
project license before unqualified reuse/distribution licensing claims.
Existing third-party material retains its original notices and terms:
see dashboard/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, vendored asset licenses, and the
license notice in research/paper/IEEEtran.cls.
